#Notes
// Workbook marks 4/4 with occasional 2/4 or passing chords; it does not locate every short bar. Follow the worship leader's count.
// The workbook goes from bridge x2 to an acoustic-only chorus and then an all-in final chorus. This chart also has an instrumental and another bridge x2 between those choruses; confirm whether to use those extra sections.
> Lead: Sis Aryet on verse 1; Aryet plus support on the first chorus. All voices from verse 2 onward.
> First chorus: add bass. Chorus after verse 2: full band in.

